<!--
    ============================================================
    KernelExtensions 目标机操作动作示例
    KernelExtensions Target-computer Action Examples
    ============================================================
    这 9 个动作各自只做一件事，可以自由组合成动作序列。
    These nine actions each do exactly one thing; combine them freely into sequences.

    共同约定 / Common conventions
      · TargetComp ：目标机 idName。留空 / NONE = 当前连接的节点。
                     Target computer idName. Empty or NONE = the currently connected node.
      · Delay      ：延迟多少秒后才执行本动作（基类提供）。留空 = 立即。
                     Seconds to wait before this action runs (provided by the base class).
                     Empty = immediately.
      · 目标机找不到 → 记一条 Warn 并跳过，不会崩、也不会静默。
                     A missing target logs a warning and skips; it never crashes and never
                     fails silently.
      · 端口协议名列表用逗号或分号分隔都行（ssh,ftp / ssh;ftp）。
                     Port protocol lists accept either commas or semicolons.

    这些动作不做权限检查：它们像剧情脚本一样直接改目标机状态。
    要"玩家破解成功后才生效"，就把它挂在对应动作点上（OnComplete 等）。
    These actions perform no permission checks: they change the target directly, like a story
    script. To make something happen only after the player succeeds, hang it on the matching
    action hook (OnComplete and friends).
-->
<Actions>

  <!-- ── 端口 / Ports ──
       PortOpen  ：打开端口        PortClose ：关闭端口
       PortOpen opens ports; PortClose closes them.
       Ports 必填；协议须已在目标机上存在。
       Ports is required; each protocol must already exist on the target. -->
  <PortOpen Ports="ssh,ftp" />
  <PortClose Ports="smtp" TargetComp="targetNode" />

  <!-- ── 防火墙 / Firewall ──
       PortFirewallAdd       ：放一份新防火墙（写完 solved=false）
                               Place a new firewall (leaves solved = false).
       PortFirewallSolve     ：解开防火墙
                               Solve the firewall.
       PortFirewallReroll    ：换掉解法（防火墙还在，解法变了）
                               Reroll the solution (the firewall stays, its answer changes).
       PortFirewallConfigure ：调整现有防火墙的参数
                               Adjust the parameters of the existing firewall.
     -->
  <PortFirewallAdd Solution="@random" Length="12" AdditionalDelay="0.1" />
  <PortFirewallSolve />
  <PortFirewallReroll Length="12" AdditionalDelay="0.3" Reset="true" />
  <PortFirewallConfigure Length="20" AdditionalDelay="0.2" Solution="@random" Reset="true" />

  <!-- ── 代理 / Proxy ──
       PortProxyAdd   ：给目标机加代理（proxyActive = true）
                       Add a proxy to the target (proxyActive = true).
       PortProxySolve ：解除代理（proxyActive = false，正在跑的破解进程随之结束）
                       Solve the proxy (proxyActive = false; a running crack process ends too).
       PortProxyReset ：过载进度归零、代理仍生效（"对手把进度打回去了"）
                       Reset overload progress while the proxy stays active (the opponent
                       pushed your progress back).
     -->
  <PortProxyAdd Time="10" />
  <PortProxySolve />
  <PortProxyReset />

  <!-- ── 延迟执行 / Delayed execution ──
       Delay 是基类属性，任何动作都能用。
       Delay comes from the base class and works on every action.
       例：破解成功 12 秒后，对手反应过来补一道防火墙。
       Example: 12 seconds after the crack succeeds, the target reacts and adds a firewall. -->
  <PortFirewallAdd Solution="@random" Length="16" Delay="12" />

  <!-- ── 一个完整的"反制"序列 / A full counter-play sequence ──
       目标机在玩家破解成功后：关掉 ftp、补一道随机防火墙、把代理进度清零。
       After the player cracks in: close ftp, add a random firewall, reset the proxy progress. -->
  <PortClose Ports="ftp" />
  <PortFirewallAdd Solution="@random" Length="16" AdditionalDelay="0.3" />
  <PortProxyReset />

</Actions>

<!--
    ============================================================
    用法备忘 / Usage notes
    ============================================================

    [放进 PortHackV2 的动作点 / Hooking them into PortHackV2]
      PortHackV2 不再有 <Buffs>/<Debuffs> 效果串 —— 一次性效果一律写成动作文件，
      再由配置的动作点引用：
      PortHackV2 has no <Buffs>/<Debuffs> effect strings any more: one-shot effects are written
      as action files and referenced from an action hook:
        <PortHackV2Config>
          <OnComplete>Actions/crackSuccess.xml</OnComplete>
          ...
          <Protocol>
            <Name>ssh</Name>
            <OnFail>Actions/sshFail.xml</OnFail>
          </Protocol>
        </PortHackV2Config>
      · 根级 OnComplete ：总时长跑满、整体收尾时
                          Root OnComplete: when the total time elapses and everything settles.
      · 协议级 OnComplete / OnFail ：该协议自己的时长跑完时立即执行（不等其它协议）
                          Protocol-level OnComplete / OnFail: fire as soon as that protocol's
                          own duration elapses, without waiting for the others.
      · 根级没有 OnFail（根级不掷 RNG，不会有"整体失败"）
                          There is no root-level OnFail (the root has no RNG, so there is no
                          "overall failure").

    [只做一件事 / One thing per action]
      需要"开端口 + 加防火墙"就写两条动作，不要期待一个动作有多种模式 ——
      这样作者读配置时一眼能看出到底做了什么。
      Need "open a port and add a firewall"? Write two actions. No action has modes, so a
      reader can see at a glance what a config actually does.

    [路径 / Paths]
      动作文件路径相对扩展根目录，且不得越界（`..` / 绝对路径会被拒绝并记 Warn）。
      Action file paths are relative to the extension root and must not escape it
      (`..` and absolute paths are rejected with a warning).
-->
